er washing, 55℃ hot air drying, self-cleaning maintenance, and up to 65 days of auto dust emptying, it delivers a truly hands-free experience.</span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item">Edge-to-Edge Cleaning with Smart Reach: FlexiArm technology extends the side brush and mop to reach corners, edges, and under furniture where dirt hides. Mark curtains in the app, and the robot cleans behind them intelligently—leaving no blind spots and no missed messes.</span></li>  <li class="a-spacing-mini"><span class="a-list-item">AI-Powered App Control: Control everything in the Roborock App, including SmartPlan 3.0, which learns your home and routines to optimize cleaning with one tap. Voice control, smart mapping, and the built-in RGB camera let you check in on your pets anytime, delivering a smarter, more effortless clean for pet-loving homes. (Supports 2.4GHz and 5GHz Wi-Fi)</span></li>     </ul>       </div>     </div>                                </div>
