al/default._SX110_.png"></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Alison Sandell</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-mobile_1VEFO"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star-small a-star-small-5 aok-align-center"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span><div data-hook="review-badges"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></div></div><h4 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-CA">Amazing for keeping floors clean with multiple pets.</h4><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-small a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in Canada on July 30, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><span data-hook="format-strip-linkless" class="a-size-small a-color-secondary">Colour Name: Black-01</span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P _Y3Itd_mobile_lV1ss" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-19"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-19-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-19-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-RPRF93EV3K058_1_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-19-card0" data-csa-c-id="h67uzt-kxkmwj-8gamvl-skca9g"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="100" style="max-height:100px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-CA" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>This purchase has been vastly life changing. I was skeptical that this robot vacuum/mop would be able to handle my filthy floors. If any household is going to put this to the test, it’s my household. We have two giant breed dogs (mastiff and a Pyrenees) that are constantly shedding copious amounts of fur, not to mention the dirt and dust they track in and the drool. I had given up on having clean floors as I could not keep up with daily vacuuming. I was doubtful that the vacuum would have large enough capacity for the amount of fur, but it certainly manages. I am also not very tech savvy, but found the app set-up user friendly and intuitive. I have set the robot to vacuum the entire house every day and additional vacuum and mop 3x per week (I have the empty dustbin feature set to most frequent). It does an amazing job. The internal dust bag seems to last a month before full and the water reservoir requires refilling about once every 2 weeks. There is still plenty of floor cleaner after 1 month of frequent mopping. Anyone else wondering if this can handle a multi pet household, I thoroughly recommend.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="dfp72y-c36u6p-wgnxqk-lufl57"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-row"><div class="a-row a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-small a-color-tertiary">4 people found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-row a-spacing-top-small"><div class="a-row _Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B0G64MM1HM" data-id="RPRF93EV3K058" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-RPRF93EV3K058_1_helpful_button" data-csa-c-id="33y0cy-e10cer-d3887r-u5xqk6"><span class="a-button a-button-base" id="a-autoid-11"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-11-announce"><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true" id="a-autoid-11-announce"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-text-mobile_34bon">Helpful</div></span></span></span></div><span data-hook="helpfulVoteLoadingMessage" class="_Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD">Sending feedback...</span><div data-hook="helpfulVoteSuccessMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success _Y3Itd_hidden_1J5OD a-spacing-block" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content">Thank you for your feedback.</div></div></div><div data-hook="helpfulVoteErrorMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert