ook="reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="R396UY0RS150KO" data-asin="B0G64MM1HM" data-mobile="true" data-locale="en-CA" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-CA" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="false" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="A2EUQ1WTGCTBG2"><div id="R396UY0RS150KO" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R396UY0RS150KO_7" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="mobley-review-content" class="a-section a-spacing-large aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="f95e4i-hfgput-bq19yf-ifzt91"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row"><a href="/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AF6CCP6LSNPCNPXLURTIAP5AGIGA?ref=cm_cr_dp_mb_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R396UY0RS150KO_7_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="86h4z5-7rdjf4-yntlrm-7s93vu"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX110_.png"></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Amazon Customer</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-mobile_1VEFO"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star-small a-star-small-3 aok-align-center"><span class="a-icon-alt">3 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span><div data-hook="review-badges"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></div></div><h4 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-CA">Should be perfect for the price but its not</h4><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-small a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in Canada on September 1, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><span data-hook="format-strip-linkless" class="a-size-small a-color-secondary">Colour Name: Black-01</span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P _Y3Itd_mobile_lV1ss" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-25"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-25-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-25-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R396UY0RS150KO_7_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-25-card0" data-csa-c-id="c329ml-cofhn2-6crifs-i0bwaz"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="100" style="max-height:100px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-CA" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>I am going to be harsh considering the premium price.</span></p><p><span>First of all, I had to return my first order after 28 days of daily use. One of the wheel completely seized up for no apparent reason. Fortunately, the support wasnt an hassle and sent a replacement, but thank god this was in the 30 days warranty ?</span></p><p><span>Next let's talk features coming from an older premium roomba. This robot is leaps above, make no mistakes. I just wanted a premium robot able to handle pets hair (2 bernese mountain dogs). And I barely, if ever, have to intervene, where I would have to manually do so almost daily with another model. Where a roomba will suicide into every object, this robot is very respectful of the objects in his path, although I find they overtuned the AI detection for dog poop. (I never have dog poop in my house, but it seems to think every chair leg is one...)</span></p><p><span>Lastly, I am removing more points for the software. There is seemingly no way to control the robot pressure anymore ? Every answer I find isn't reflected in today's software version. No way to setup permanent "zones" and assign rules or quick routines to them. The remote control feature requires manual authorization on the robot every time, so it serves no purpose if I cant monitor my home when outside. And the mapping is very BAD. My home layout is very simple and traditional but it required heavy manual correction to even remotely make sense of my layout. It couldn't even map simples walls and created fictional spaces between the room. And if you have mirrors, dood luck...</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="qb9ygl-f23bnn-3i3u3q-23mz14"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-w