sh.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">THREE FULL-SIZE FORMULAS FOR DEEPER CARE — Includes 2.12 oz of saddle soap, 2.12 oz of mink oil and 2.12 oz of waterproofing wax. Each formula performs a separate job, helping clean away grime, soften dry leather, restore a richer appearance and protect boots beyond a quick surface shine.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">DEDICATED TOOLS FOR CLEANER, MORE EVEN RESULTS — Use the large horsehair brush to remove dust and buff the leather, the applicator brush to spread oil and wax evenly, and the detail brush to reach seams, welts and hard-to-clean edges. Separate tools help reduce mess and prevent product buildup.</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">MADE FOR BOOTS &amp; SHOES - Suitable for work boots, cowboy boots, and leather shoes, this kit is ideal for anyone who values proper leather care. Whether used for routine maintenance or seasonal conditioning, it makes a practical and refined gift for men who take pride in their footwear and leather goods.</span></li>  </ul> </div>           <div id="pqv-description" data-target="#productDescription_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <h2 id="pqv-description-heading">Product description</h2>    <div>
