ard _Y3Itd_single-review-carousel-element_10Sgf" aria-setsize="4" aria-posinset="3"><button class="_Y3Itd_single-review-thumbnail-container_9KgXc" data-mix-operations="SingleReviewMediaImageThumbnailClickHandler" data-mediatype="IMAGE" data-url="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A7eMAYpEL.jpg" data-thumbnailurl="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A7eMAYpEL._SY500_.jpg" data-physicalid="71A7eMAYpEL" data-asin="B0GXF7ZQPY" data-reviewid="RTA91PZMEBNZA" data-rank="3"><img alt="Premium robot cleaner that will take a bit of study to get maximum benefit." src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71A7eMAYpEL._SY500_.jpg" data-hook="single-review-image-thumbnail" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-image-thumbnail_Q0oVq"></button></li></ol></div><span class="a-end aok-hidden"></span></div></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P _Y3Itd_mobile_lV1ss" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-23"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-23-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-23-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-RTA91PZMEBNZA_7_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-23-card0" data-csa-c-id="23rbte-leh2l-d4um47-klmmdu"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="100" style="max-height:100px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-CA" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>This robot vacuum is awesome. It does the stuff you expect: map the floor plan, vacuum the floor, don't cause damage. This is my second robot vacuum and it is superior to the other for obstacle avoidance and adapting to surface changes. It does not get caught on the area carpet and anti-fatigue mats don't bother it either. Occasionally, a shoelace will get caught in the roller brush and that is easy to untangle. The mop feature is something special. The robot will use rotating pads and cleaning solution (or plain water) to mop the floor. Dirty rinse water is collected by the base station for dumping when it gets full. My only hesitation to award 5 stars relates to the hickups I experienced with network connectivity. For some reason my home router dislikes the traffic produced by the robot. When the ap on my smartphone reports a network outage I turn off the wifi and use my cellular data to connect with the roborock service. The robot will map the floor and vaccuum manually if you are not connected with the ap. However, you need the ap and connectivity to update the floor plan, specify rooms, no-go areas and instructions about mopping. To get the full benefit of this device you will probably need to spend some time learning about the features and how they apply to your dwelling. I do like the way the base station is designed and how the robot is sheltered in it when docked. This is a premium product.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="ctbmnz-ktg6x-ug5ppp-ezow9r"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand