d_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX110_.png"></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Texas Shopper</span></div></div></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-mobile_1VEFO"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star-small a-star-small-5 aok-align-center"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span><div data-hook="review-badges"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></div></div><h4 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">This thing is such an upgrade! My floors have never been cleaner.</h4><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-small a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on September 3, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><span data-hook="format-strip-linkless" class="a-size-small a-color-secondary">Colour Name: White-02</span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P _Y3Itd_mobile_lV1ss" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-26"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-26-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-26-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review_foreign-RGLRQFM4S0PRO_2_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-26-card0" data-csa-c-id="2ob9yv-gwbom3-ro9lxp-cqfqsr"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="100" style="max-height:100px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>I had a very (very-very) basic robot vacuum that I was happy enough with, so I was sad when it finally went kaput. I definitely wanted to replace it. After much research and deliberation--and feeling completely overwhelmed at the vast number of choices--I finally settled on the Roborock Qrevo S5V and I am so happy with my choice. I am so impressed with how well it functions and all the things it does to make my life easier and my house cleaner! It is controlled mainly with the Roborock app, and if there is something you want done, the app will pretty much let you tell the robot to do it. You can vacuum only, mop only, vacuum the whole house then mop the whole house, or set it to sort of vacuum and mop at the same time (though not actually at the very same time). You can tell it what time to start working on what day, and make your schedule as complicated or as simplified as you like. One huge feature for me is that while my old robot just kind of wandered around randomly, the Qrevo S5V methodically covers every square inch. I can look at the app and see exactly where it has cleaned and where it has not. this feature is excellent and such a huge upgrade.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>As far as how well it cleans, I am so impressed with the vacuuming, especially. I have long hair, two dogs and lots of nature outside, so my own hair, dog hair, leaves, grass clippings and dust seem to build up on my floors very quickly. The S5V's brushes and suctioning do a thorough job of picking it all up, but I do find I need to manually clean corners and some other oddly shaped spaces the robot can't get to. I really love the split roller brushes ("DuoDivide" brushes) because they prevent dog hair (and my own long hair) from tangling and gumming up the brushes. I am not quite sure how it works, but it is a marvel of engineering that after vacuuming, the two roller brushes are nearly hair free and tangles are not an issue. It is because of the split design. If you have pets or long hair of your own, whether you get the S5V or some other Roborock model, I recommend making sure it has the DuoDivide brush feature.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>As for mopping, this feature is really helping me out because my home has lots of square feet of polished concrete, and mopping the whole thing is quite the dreaded chore. The robot's mopping job is not as thorough as a manual one done by a human, but between the vacuum's regularly scheduled dust/hair removal followed by the basic mopping job, this robot is keeping my floors cleaner and looking so much better than they have in years. Mopping the floors in this house is such a chore that I would have to psyche myself up for the job, but now that this robot takes care of so much of it for me, the floors look nice day-in/day-out, and when I want to give them a thorough mopping myself, it's so much quicker and easier because the floors are soooo much cleaner to start with. Even if I have skipped my own mopping job, I am not embarrassed if friends or neighbors drop by unannounced because my floors look nice at all times thanks to this robot.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I do get tripped up on the app sometimes when programming jobs, but there is a wonderful Roborock community on Reddit and all I have to do it post a question there and someone helpful will answer it. Overall, I am extrememly pleased with the Qrevo S5V. My floors have never looked better and with so little effort. It has inspired me to keep my entire house cleaner and also given me more time to attend to other areas of my home.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="1s858j-278zuh-i204f5-yfjqw"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-row"><div class="a-row a-spacing-top-small"><div class="a-row _Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="reportAbuseButton" data-mix-operations="ReportAbuseOpenDialogClickHandler" data-dialog-kind="sheet" data-asin="B0FX4SZ4KB" data-id="RGLRQFM4S0PRO" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review_foreign-RGLRQFM4S0PRO_2_report_button" data-csa-c-id="ua5uqo-r8h4xw-gdicfs-hvw63i"><a aria-label="Report Review" class="a-size-base a-link-normal a-color-secondary a-text-normal" href="javascript:void(0)" role="button">Report</a></div><span data-hook="reportAbuseSendingMessage" class="_Y3Itd_hidden_ySuSy">Sending feedback...</span><div data-hook="reportAbuseSuccessMessage" class="a-b