ve" data-csa-c-id="89wssf-ma1b1y-war379-mkub64"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row"><div class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX110_.png"></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">lamoon88</span></div></div></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-mobile_1VEFO"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star-small a-star-small-5 aok-align-center"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span><div data-hook="review-badges"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></div></div><h4 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">INCREDIBLE</h4><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-small a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on September 30, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><span data-hook="format-strip-linkless" class="a-size-small a-color-secondary">Colour Name: Black</span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P _Y3Itd_mobile_lV1ss" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-27"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-27-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-27-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review_foreign-R1F1PKFPRYPIKN_3_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-27-card0" data-csa-c-id="l5g5a6-plzp4-vwcb5n-57y606"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="100" style="max-height:100px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>AMAZING! We are on day two of having this and so far, it far surpasses all the others I’ve tried. In the past 3 months, I have used Eufy’s rental program to rent the Omni Pro S2 and returned it. It was majorly overpriced for what it did. I then rented the Eufy e25. It would be the runner up out of all I’ve tried, but it still doesn’t come close to what this Roborock has done so far. I purchased the Roomba Plus 405 and again…I wasn’t impressed with the mopping feature. Last I purchased the Shark Thermacharged and had high hopes because I’ve never been let down by Shark….until this purchase. When it would mop, it was picking up very little of the water. I had gone through two clean water tanks and the dirty water tank wasn’t even half full. I returned it and decided to give this Roborock a try, but didn’t expect much since it’s not one of the common brands. So far, I’m in love.</span></p><p><span>I use my robot vacuum and mops multiple times a day. My house is just shy of 5000sqft with 8 bedrooms and four bathrooms. No carpet in the house at all. I have 5 kids and 7 dogs. We have a small farm. So no matter how much I clean, the floors are still gonna get dirty quickly. The robot helps me stay on top of things and allows me to just deep clean the floors around once a week.</span></p><p><span>I cannot believe how clean this Roborock has got the floors. And the dirty water tank is filling up, so that’s an improvement from my previous robot. The mapping within the app is INCREDIBLE. It is so easy to edit the map, label rooms, add flooring type, add door thresholds the robot will have to go over, etc. The app alone blows all the others I’ve tried out of the ballpark.</span></p><p><span>I’ll update if anything changes, but so far, I am beyond happy with this thing.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="ehgh87-n8yu5y-ybc0ln-z9nlnc"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-row"><div class="a-row a-spacing-top-small"><div class="a-row _Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="reportAbuseButton" data-mix-operations="ReportAbuseOpenDialogClickHandler" data-dialog-kind="sheet" data-asin="B0GXF7ZQPY" data-id="R1F1PKFPRYPIKN" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review_foreign-R1F1PKFPRYPIKN_3_report_button" data-csa-c-id="wv0lin-kg4o76-ewojio-mzr1we"><a aria-label="Report Review" class="a-size-base a-lin