p="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="A2EUQ1WTGCTBG2"><div id="R3IZQJ77UAMARA" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review_foreign-R3IZQJ77UAMARA_4" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="mobley-review-content" class="a-section a-spacing-large aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="o6fy7c-rux849-pgyr3g-rt11kd"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row"><div class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/G/01/x-locale/common/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX110_.png"></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">PabloHoney1654</span></div></div></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-mobile_1VEFO"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star-small a-star-small-5 aok-align-center"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span><div data-hook="review-badges"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></div></div><h4 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">Wow, simply wow</h4><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-small a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on September 27, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><span data-hook="format-strip-linkless" class="a-size-small a-color-secondary">Colour Name: Black</span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P _Y3Itd_mobile_lV1ss" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-28"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-28-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-28-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review_foreign-R3IZQJ77UAMARA_4_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-28-card0" data-csa-c-id="pbx2hu-pfm9by-chvh5w-npd0t4"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="100" style="max-height:100px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Wow, simply wow! There has been a tiny spot in my kitchen, no bigger than a dime, that I could not get to go away for the life of me. I had honestly decided it was part of the floor, but Roborock, or "Rocky" as I call him, wasnt having it. I actually watched as it wiggled its little robo-rear mop pads over it for a good 3 or so minutes and it was gone. The spot is gone!</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>The rest of the house, it does incredible. When I look at the map of my home its created, the accuracy is beyond anything Id ever seen with my iRobot. I actually know which room is which. It runs quiet, even on max vacuum/mop mode. For those on the fence, I HIGHLY recommend the purchase. Ive only had it a week and its my favorite purchase</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interact