+    </p>                                                <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buybox-action" data-pqv-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buybox" data-target="#buybox" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#buybox"> Purchasing options </a> </span> </p>                <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-buying-options-action" data-pqv-buying-options-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-buying-options" data-target="#olpLinkWidget_feature_div &gt; div.a-section.olp-link-widget" class="a-link-normal" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#olpLinkWidget_feature_div"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p> <p class="a-text-italic"> <span class="a-declarative" data-action="pqv-unqualified-buybox-action" data-pqv-unqualified-buybox-action="{}"> <a id="pqv-unqualified-buybox" data-target="#unqualifiedBuyBox" class="a-link-normal aok-hidden" href="?ref=dp_product_quick_view#unqualifiedBuyBox"> Other sellers </a> </span> </p>  </div>         <div id="pqv-feature-bullets" data-target="#featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium"> <h2 id="pqv-feature-bullets-heading">About this Item</h2> <ul class="a-unordered-list a-vertical">  <li><span class="a-list-item">20,000 Pa Robot Vacuum for Deep Cleaning: Power through dust, pet hair, crumbs, and debris with 20,000 Pa HyperForce suction. This robot vacuum and mop automatically boosts suction on carpets while delivering powerful cleaning across hardwood, tile, and other hard floors</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Zero-Tangle Cleaning for Pet-Friendly Homes: The Dual Zero-Tangle System combines an anti-tangle side brush with the DuoDivide main brush to minimize hair wrap while effectively lifting long hair and pet fur. Spend less time maintaining your robot vacuum cleaner and more time enjoying clean floors</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">FlexiArm Tech Cleans Every Edge &amp; Corner: The FlexiArm Edge Mopping System extends to clean as close as 1.85 mm along walls for exceptional edge coverage, while the reversible side brush reaches deep into corners for up to 30% more corner coverage. Capture dust where traditional robot vacuums often miss</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Carpet Care Protects Every Floor: Designed for mixed-floor homes, this robot vacuum automatically removes the mop when needed, vacuums carpets before mopping, lifts the mopping module up to 15 mm, and boosts suction for deeper carpet cleaning. Transition seamlessly between hardwood, tile, rugs, and low-pile carpets without extra effort</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Self-Emptying Dock Cleans &amp; Dries Automatically: The upgraded multifunctional dock automatically empties dust, refills the water tank, performs 65°C high-temperature mop self-cleaning, dries the mop with 45°C warm air, and features a upgraded cleaning tray with soaking mode for easier upkeep</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Smart Navigation Avoids Everyday Obstacles: Reactive Tech Obstacle Avoidance helps the robot vacuum move smoothly around everyday obstacles. Quick Mapping rapidly creates your home layout, while 3D Map Display lets you customize cleaning with greater accuracy and control</span></li>  <li><span class="a-list-item">Smart Cleaning That Adapts to Your Home: Roborock SmartPlan 3.0 automatically adjusts cleaning based on your home, floor types, and cleaning history. Operating at a quiet 54 dB, this robot vacuum is ideal for homes with children and pets, delivering powerful cleaning with less disruption</span></li>  </ul> </div>           <div id="pqv-description" data-target="#productDescription_feature_div" class="a-section a-spacing-medium">  <h2 id="pqv-description-heading">Product description</h2>    <div>
+                    The Roborock 2026 New Qrevo 2 Pro Robot Vacuum and Mop combines 20,000Pa HyperForce suction for deep cleaning of dust, pet hair, crumbs, and debris across hardwood, tile, and carpets, automatically boosting suction on carpets. Its Dual Zero-Tangle System features an anti-tangle side brush and DuoDivide main brush to minimize hair wrap, reducing maintenance. The FlexiArm Edge Mopping System extends to 1.85mm along walls for exceptional coverage, while the reversible side brush reaches corners for up to 30% more coverage. Designed for mixed floors, it automatically removes the mop, vacuums carpets before mopping, lifts the module 15mm, and boosts suction for carpets. The upgraded dock empties dust, refills water, self-cleans the mop at 149°F, dries with 113°F warm air, and features a soaking mode tray. Reactive Tech Obstacle Avoidance ensures smooth navigation, Quick Mapping creates layouts, and 3D Map Display enables customization. SmartPlan 3.0 adapts to your home’s layout, floor types, and history, operating at 54dB for quiet, child- and pet-friendly cleaning.  </div>
